2026-10-24 — Hero rebuilt around frame 1 (src/components/Hero*.tsx, src/styles/hero*.css)
- Sampled f_001.webp edges with sharp: top #adb4b4/#a9b3b2, mid #b7bebd, bottom
  #ced5d5/#dae0e0. Page gradient uses the spec stops #C9D0D2 -> #D5DBDC -> #E1E7E8.
- Grain: CSS-only repeating-radial-gradient at 4% (no SVG file, no data URI).
- Wheel: cropped with sharp to public/vault-frames/wheel.png (r=68px, feathered
  circular alpha), rotated as its own layer. No conic-gradient fallback needed.
- Hotspot corrections (>1% off measured): lower dial y 61.8 -> 60.4, handle
  y 36-63 -> 39-60.5, door seam = door-plate rounded rect.
- Buttons anchored to top:61.8% at >=1366px; below that they flow after the body
  because the mandated type scale does not fit above the line in a 38.2% column.
- Vault drawn width capped at 112% viewport + canvas feathered so it never crosses
  into the text column at 1024.
- Fonts self-hosted in public/fonts and preloaded from index.html: CLS 0.00.
- /signup and /signin are not registered routes yet — navigation lands on the
  catch-all until those pages exist.
